{"title":"Career roadmap · DApp Developer","role":"DApp Developer","summary":"A DApp (Decentralised Application) Developer builds applications that interact with blockchain networks through smart contracts and decentralised infrastructure. The role combines frontend/backend development, blockchain protocols, smart contracts, wallets, cryptography and Web3 security.","facts":{"Starts":"Year 1","Current degree":"BCA (Bachelor of Computer Applications)","Course":"BCA – Blockchain / Web3","Timeline assumption":"3-year BCA beginning in 2026 → graduation around 2029. For a 4-year honours structure, graduation would typically be around 2030."},"about":[{"label":"Alignment","text":"Direct"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career-route check","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["BCA Blockchain/Web3","Programming + Web fundamentals","Blockchain fundamentals","Solidity + smart contracts","DApp projects","Internship","Junior DApp Developer","Blockchain Developer","Senior/Protocol Engineer"]}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","What to focus on"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2029/30"},{"text":"Build programming, web development, cryptography, blockchain and smart-contract fundamentals."}],[{"text":"2029–2034"},{"text":"Become a production Web3/DApp developer and specialise in smart contracts, DeFi, infrastructure or security."}],[{"text":"2034–2040"},{"text":"Progress toward Senior Blockchain Engineer, Smart Contract Engineer, Protocol Engineer or Web3 Architect."}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Move toward Principal/Protocol Architect, Engineering Lead, Web3 infrastructure leadership or blockchain research."}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Programming"},{"text":"JavaScript/TypeScript + Python"},{"text":"Coding portfolio"},{"